、优待政策  \n- 经济：学费补偿（最高8000元/年）+助学贷款代偿，地方家庭优待金（湖北标准咨询“荆楚长城”）；  \n- 升学：考研初试+10分，专项计划8000名额，立功免试读研，保留学籍/应届身份；  \n- 就业：考公/事业编设专项岗，专场招聘；  \n- 优先：烈士子女、现役子女、灾区优秀青年、老区后代优先批准。  \n\n### 五、注意事项  \n- 18岁男公民须兵役登记，有意愿再应征；  \n- 湖北本地关注“荆楚长城”“湖北征兵”公众号；  \n- 直招军士限全日制毕业生（专业对口），年龄≤24岁，研究生≤26岁。  \n\n当前下半年报名中，速登录官网填报，按武装部指引推进！"},"type":2}],"hide_action_bar":0,"hide_analysis_bar":0,"hit_cache":false,"hit_security_check":false,"is_end":false,"is_user_auth":0,"key":"segk_20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30_4","next_key":"segk_20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30_5","next_sse_key":"ssek_20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30_2","res_type":0,"ret_message":"","search_id":"20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30","security_message":"","sse_key":"ssek_20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30_1","trace_info":{"ai_search_send_timestamp_ms":1781499942185,"ai_search_source_type":"ai_top1_offline_search","card_level":2,"enter_from_second":"top1","generation_type":2,"hit_cache":1,"segment_get_timestamp_ms":1781499942129}},"doc_id":"4029356670","search_id":"20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30"},"info":{"cache_search_id":"20260522225524B85FA1E73124EA4B1C13"},"is_end":false,"key":"segk_20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30_4","next_key":"segk_20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30_5","search_id":"20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30","voice_cmd":""},{"args":{"aladdin_rank":0,"card_level":2,"data_type":"","disable_typewriter_effect":false,"hit_cache":false,"id":"20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30_2","insert_action":"","insert_id":"","is_general_search_online":false,"parent_id":"20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF30_1","rank":0,"render_next_after_finished":false,"replace_id":""},"chunk_end":false,"cmd":"Append","display":{"answer_online_general_search_id":"2026061513053329ACFA0896784FB7176C","display":{"debug_info":"","generation_spans":[{"meta_status":{"status":26},"type":4}],"hide_action_bar":0,"hide_analysis_bar":0,"hit_cache":false,"hit_security_check":false,"is_end":false,"is_user_auth":0,"key":"segk_20260615130542DCA9D27F481C2EDCFF